      "checkpoint": [
        "Hiker Nob (27, 9) faces north over (27, 6..8), Camper Flint (28, 4) south over (28, 5..7): every way east crosses one. Nob is fought on the step onto (27, 8), beside him; the way on keeps off Flint's column, by one-tile legs and legs to walls.",
        "Youngster Chad (36, 4) walks up and down column 36 (the map's wander box, rows 1..7), so he may see any tile of it down to row 9: every way east crosses it within his sight. The way crosses his column on row 9, a leg to the water at (42, 9), where he can only walk up beside it; if he sees the player, story_interrupts() fight him, as the sim, which looks from every tile of his box, always does.",
